    <preface>
      <p>Treatment Benefits (Special Access) (Consequential Amendments and Transitional Provisions) Act 2019</p>
      <p>No. 42, 2019</p>
      <p>An Act to deal with consequential and transitional matters arising from the enactment of the <i>Treatment Benefits (Special Access)</i><i> </i><i>Act 2019</i>, and for related purposes</p>
      <p>Contents</p>
      <p>1	Short title	2</p>
      <p>2	Commencement	2</p>
      <p>3	Schedules	2</p>
      <p>Schedule 1—Transitional provisions	3</p>
      <p>Schedule 2—Consequential amendments	4</p>
